        "node_id": "n_5_2c9e5d",
        "thought_text": "Implementing a priority queue (min-heap) could help efficiently manage the assignment of distinct ratings while keeping track of the smallest available rating. This approach ensures that the smallest possible rating is always assigned first, minimizing the total sum.",
